# Clan Quarra: "Vampire Amulet" (VA_VampAmulet). Volrina Quarra wants the makings of an amulet ("use to me": 10):
# five extravagant sapphire amulets, two void salts, a daedra's heart, vampire dust and a skull. Given all of them
# ("raw materials") she rewards the player (30).
# 🛑 Morrowind.esm's own bug: "use to me" logs 10, and "raw materials" answers only below 10 (then offers the
# choice to 20), so at 10 Volrina has nothing to say on it -- and, unanswerable, the topic is never learned from her
# text (OpenMW's addTopicsFromText keeps only topics the speaker can answer). UESP (Morrowind:The Quarra Amulet,
# Bugs, confirmed) gives the player's console fix, `Journal VA_VampAmulet 20` and `AddTopic "raw materials"`,
# which the case runs in place of the dead choice. Kills of twelve Aundae or Berne
# vampires while the quest stands at 30 (Vampire_Aundae counts VampKills on death) earn the clan's last reward
# ("future rewards"; its response has no result script in Morrowind.esm, so 40 never logs -- the journal stays at 30).
# AddItem stands in for gathering the materials, the kills for the fights, `approach` for the travel.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance --instance 2 mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --from va_quarra_amulet_start --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case va_quarra_amulet_start
approach 05D57D27
talk volrina quarra
ask use to me
expect GetJournalIndex VA_VampAmulet == 10
bye
run
Journal VA_VampAmulet 20
AddTopic "raw materials"
player->AddItem "extravagant_amulet_01" 5
player->AddItem "ingred_void_salts_01" 2
player->AddItem "ingred_daedras_heart_01" 1
player->AddItem "ingred_vampire_dust_01" 1
player->AddItem "misc_skull10" 1
wait 30
talk volrina quarra
ask raw materials
expect GetJournalIndex VA_VampAmulet == 30
bye
end

case va_quarra_rewards
approach 053E1E58
console 053E1E58.kill
wait 60
approach 052D64B1
console 052D64B1.kill
wait 60
approach 053C5D68
console 053C5D68.kill
wait 60
approach 05826ECA
console 05826ECA.kill
wait 60
approach 05BE5476
console 05BE5476.kill
wait 60
approach 057AF45F
console 057AF45F.kill
wait 60
approach 053E90AA
console 053E90AA.kill
wait 60
approach 05DAF1FD
console 05DAF1FD.kill
wait 60
approach 05588CCD
console 05588CCD.kill
wait 60
approach 05D63F0E
console 05D63F0E.kill
wait 60
approach 05572B34
console 05572B34.kill
wait 60
approach 05DC6EA3
console 05DC6EA3.kill
wait 60
expect VampKills >= 12
approach 05D57D27
talk volrina quarra
ask future rewards
expect GetJournalIndex VA_VampAmulet == 30
bye
end
